{
  "name": "Jira <-> n8n bridge (example)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "jira-bridge",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Jira events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "jira-bridge",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Jira bridge secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "url",
              "name": "jiraInboundUrl",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "PASTE_THE_URL_FROM_JIRA_SETTINGS"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $('Jira events').item.json.body.event }}",
                    "rightValue": "issue_created",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "New issue"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $('Jira events').item.json.body.event }}",
                    "rightValue": "issue_commented",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $('Jira events').item.json.body.comment.text }}",
                    "rightValue": "/done",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "startsWith"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Comment starting with /done"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $('Jira events').item.json.body.event }}",
                    "rightValue": "issue_updated",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "Issue updated"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "What happened in Jira",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.jiraInboundUrl }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ issueKey: $('Jira events').item.json.body.issueKey, action: 'comment', comment: 'n8n received this new issue from project ' + $('Jira events').item.json.body.projectKey + '.' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "name": "Reply with a comment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        -200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Jira bridge secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.jiraInboundUrl }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ issueKey: $('Jira events').item.json.body.issueKey, action: 'transition', transition: 'Done' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "name": "Move the issue to Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Jira bridge secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.jiraInboundUrl }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ issueKey: $('Jira events').item.json.body.issueKey, action: 'labels', labels: ['seen-by-n8n'] }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "name": "Add a label",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Jira bridge secret"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Jira <-> n8n bridge (example)\nWorks with the **Jira n8n Bridge** Forge app.\n\n### What it does\n- A new Jira issue gets a comment back from n8n.\n- A comment starting with **/done** moves the issue to Done.\n- Any other update adds the label **seen-by-n8n**.\nReplace these three actions with your own automation: Slack, a database, an AI step, and so on.\n\n### Setup (5 minutes)\n1. In Jira, open **Settings > Apps > Connect Jira to n8n**, click **Create secret** and copy it.\n2. In n8n, create a **Header Auth** credential named \"Jira bridge secret\": name `X-Bridge-Secret`, value = the secret. Select it in **Jira events** and in the three HTTP nodes.\n3. Activate this workflow and copy the production URL of **Jira events** into the Jira settings page (n8n webhook URL).\n4. Copy the \"n8n to Jira\" URL from the same page into **Settings**.\n\nEvents sent by the app: issue_created, issue_updated (with `changes`), issue_commented (with `comment.text`). Actions it accepts: comment, transition, labels.",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 480
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -260
      ]
    }
  ],
